    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This beautifully maintained 4/5 -bedroom redbrick end of row home offers the perfect blend of comfort, privacy, and convenience. Located in a quiet cul de sac, this home is ideal for families seeking space both inside and out in a convenient location.\n\nThe property features a cobble lock driveway with off-street parking for two cars, and an inviting entrance into a warm and well-laid-out interior. The home boasts 3/4 reception rooms, Kitchen/Dining, Utility room, 4/5 generously sized bedrooms, including a master En-suite, and a large landing that enhances the sense of space upstairs.\n\nDownstairs, there's ample room for both relaxation and entertaining with separate reception rooms, a bright Kitchen, Dining room, and a versatile playroom/Bedroom 5/Home office. The home benefits from oil-fired central heating (OFCH) and a solid fuel stove, creating a cosy atmosphere year-round. \n\nSome of the standout features is the end of row & extra-large, secure rear garden, which is not overlooked, offering complete privacy perfect for children, pets, or simply unwinding outdoors.\n\nWith three well-appointed bathrooms, this property is both practical and stylish. Whether you're a growing family or simply seeking a peaceful retreat in the Midlands, this home ticks all the boxes.\n\nAccommodation\nEnt Hall 5.4m x 1.7 (17'9\" x 1.7): having Hardwood multi locking PVC hall door & glazed side panels. laminated timber flooring, radiator cover\n\nGuest WC - Wc, WHB & tiled floor\n\nLiving Room 5.5m x 3.3m (18'1\" x 10'10\"): a generous sized room with large picture window, marble fireplace with stove insert. Double Doors to:-\n\nDining Room 4m x 3.7m (13'1\" x 12'2\"): a bright multi-purpose room.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room 4.9m x 3.7m (16'1\" x 12'2\"): A full range of fitted floor & wall mounted units with tiled splash back, Tiled floor.\nPatio Doors to rear garden\n\nUtility Room 2.4m x 1.5m (7'10\" x 4'11\"): a range of floor & wall storage units, tiled floor, Rear exit door.\n\nBedroom 5/ Playroom / Home Office 4.6m x 2.3m (15'1\" x 7'7\"): a spacious multipurpose room with large picture window.\n\nLanding a spacious area with hot press & attic access, large window\n\nMaster Bedroom 4.2m x 2.6m (13'9\" x 8'6\"): a spacious room with Fitted wardrobes.\n\nEn-Suite having WC, WHB & Shower, Tiled floor.\n\nBed 2 3.3m x 2.6m (10'10\" x 8'6\"): having built in wardrobes, overlooking rear garden\n\nBed 3 2.7m x 2.4m (8'10\" x 7'10\"): another spacious room with built in wardrobes & overlooking the rear garden\n\nBed 4 2.6m x 2.2m (): having built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom with panel bath, WC & WHB. Tiled floor & part tiled walls.\n\nFeatures\n•Spacious well-appointed family home.\n•End of row location, overlooking green area\n•Not overlooked from side or rear\n•Walking distance of all amenities.\n\nFront Garden\n•Cobblelock parking area\n•Lawned area.\n\nRear Garden\n•Spacious with lawned area\n•Not overlooked on side or rear.\n"
      },
